                "priority": "WARNING",
                "description": "Below the module's own low warning (or {$PRISMA.XCVR.RX.MIN:\"{#XCVRLANE}\"} dBm): a dirty or damaged fibre or connector, a long span, or the far end's laser. Compare with the far end's TX power.",
